---
/** StoryBrand stakes block: what the rug-shop script costs the buyer. The villain is the script, never people. */
import SectionHeader from '../ui/SectionHeader.astro';
const stakes = [
  {
    title: 'Tufted rugs sold as hand-knotted.',
    body: 'A glued backing hides the difference. Photos of the front never show it.',
  },
  {
    title: '“Turkish” rugs made somewhere else.',
    body: 'A label is not a place. Without a certificate for that rug, origin is a story.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Photos that lie about color.',
    body: 'Warm light and a filter can turn rust into red. You find out when the box opens.',
  },
];
---

<section class="container-content section-pad" aria-labelledby="stakes-title">
  <SectionHeader
    id="stakes-title"
    eyebrow="What the rug-shop script costs you"
    title="Stop guessing."
    intro="Buying a rug you can’t touch is nerve-racking. The inflated tag, the “special price, just for you,” the certificate nobody can check: none of it can be tested from a screen. So I test it for you, on camera, before you pay."
  />
  <ul class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3" role="list">
    {stakes.map((s) => (
      <li class="rounded-card border border-line bg-ivory p-6">
        <h3 class="font-sans text-h4 font-semibold text-indigo">{s.title}</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-body text-charcoal">{s.body}</p>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>
  <p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-body-lg text-charcoal">
    You shouldn’t need to be an expert to buy an honest rug. Every rug here comes with the proof
    already done: the back, the knots, the fiber, the dye, and where it was made.
  </p>
</section>
